      "review_description": "Wade came to my house late in the day and stayed over an hour explaining things to me. Prior to installation he was always available at night by email to answer questions (he obviously works long days). The installation went smoothly and was done on the booked day. I've had a couple of issues since the installation; he has remedied one of them and has booked a day to come and fix the other one. I've bee told by his partner that they want their customers to be happy. I think that's  good motto for any company.",
